From 002699680fbf67b1f424c4dcd6cefb36edeed858 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 21:51:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Refuse empty-tape universe lattice; wire synthetic outcomes
 for scoring

Weekend dojo burned ~74 minutes generating a full lattice with zero
recorded sessions, then scored nothing because generate_result outcomes
were discarded and realized_pnl was never filled.

- Skip universe when recorded tape is insufficient (force_universe override)
- Keep native provider outcomes through the scoring path
- Attach per-candidate terminal P&L at settlement so evaluators match trades
- Flag universe_unscored / universe_skipped_no_tape instead of silent no-ops
